# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, and add the same
# keys under Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables for
# production. Never commit the real .env.local — it's already gitignored.

# --- Contact form ---
# The "Book a Free Second Opinion" form submits directly to formsubmit.co
# using the destination email set in `contact.email` (src/lib/site.ts) —
# no API key or environment variable needed. The first submission to a
# new address triggers a one-time confirmation email that must be
# clicked before real submissions start arriving.

# --- Analytics (optional) ---
# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID, e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX
# Create at https://analytics.google.com → Admin → Data Streams
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
